{"reviews":[{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-0","r":5.0,"t":"Good price, good quality.","x":"I sell LipSense  which is a liquid lipstick and I use a ton of testers to keep things sanitary as I sell many different colors of lipstick.  You get a good amount for a good price.  They fit right into the lipstick testers perfectly and it applies the lipstick perfectly. It does the job and it's a good price for how many you get. I recommend these to my distributors when they sign up to sell LipSense.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-1","r":5.0,"t":"Nice deal","x":"Perfect brushes for testing my Lipsence and sharing my LipSense collection with my sister. They work well, and don't take up too much product for a one-time-use brush. for this 300 pack, I believe I can use them for quite a long time.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-2","r":5.0,"t":"really nice. For a disposable product","x":"The first thing I thought when I saw the package was: 300 is so many! I totally surprised there are so many sticks. Probably I cannot use them all over a year, so I share half with my friend. For the product, really nice. For a disposable product, sometimes I feel it could be used several times. It can also substitute cotton sticks in some ways, like eye shadows. The only I was a little mind is that I received half pink sticks, 1/3 black sticks, and 1/6 white sticks\u2026 but I like white color\u2026","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-3","r":5.0,"t":"Best disposable applicators!","x":"Best disposable applicators I have found for Lipsense application. Picks up a great amount of color, and applies it nicely. They even feel super sturdy! SUPER high quality & cheap!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-4","r":5.0,"t":"Colorful and great buy.","x":"I love these disposable lipstick wands.  they are perfect for my lipstick business to be used for testing the lipsticks.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-5","r":5.0,"t":"Calling all lip lovers!","x":"I love these for freelancing as an artist, but I also love using them on myself. More and more I'm starting to use throw away applicators to help preserve my own products. I wear makeup every single day (I'm talking full face makeup) so my makeup has more of an opportunity to harbor bacteria (constantly using, opening and closing products, using my hands to apply products and putting my hands in the products themselves, etc.). I love these because #1 I can use any lip product down to the bone. Y","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-6","r":5.0,"t":"Craziest Little Things...","x":"They have a nice velvety finish and I once received something very similar in a high-end eye makeup palette. So I tried it on my eyes and it really defines the crease area of my eye when I use the stick. I also think it's great for getting into tight places that need to be cleaned, like keyboards. Very handy.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-7","r":1.0,"t":"First one I used of the pink It broke off ...","x":"First one I used of the pink It broke off in the lipgloss and now I can't get it out. Frustrating","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-8","r":4.0,"t":"I would purchase again.","x":"These lipstick wands worked really well to apply Lipsense. I would purchase again.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-9","r":3.0,"t":"Ok","x":"Black applicators were fine, pink tops seemed not as absorbent","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-10","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing wand","x":"These work amazing for sample/tester wands for lipsense","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-11","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Very nice product. I will definitely buy it again!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-12","r":5.0,"t":"... is very large and the tool kit is very useful. As we all know","x":"The quantity is very large and the tool kit is very useful. As we all know, if we directly use the lipstick to brush our lip, the lipstick will be damaged. With this tool kit, this worries can be completely taken away. The effect with the brush lipstick tool kit is also much better than directly using lipstick.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-13","r":5.0,"t":"Smooth application and sturdy","x":"After purchasing the mascara brushes for my businsss, I needed some lipstick applicators. Very happy with these! They're sturdy and the lipstick applies effortlessly. Ando this is the only company I found that sell a 300 quantity!","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-14","r":5.0,"t":"Five stars","x":"The lip brushes are well made. It applies lipstick and lip gloss evenly and smoothly on my lips. I am very satisfied with the product and the price is reasonable.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"I sell LipSense lip color and these are perfect for customers testing out the lip color using the applicator wands.  Exactly what I was looking for","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-16","r":5.0,"t":"Good quality and comes in 6 packages in different colors","x":"Good quality and comes in 6 packages in different colors. Very convenient for placing at work or in the purse. Will recommend to my friends.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-17","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome","x":"I have tried other brands and this one is by far the best one.  I use them when mixing LipSense colors together and they work very well.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-18","r":5.0,"t":"Great tester wands","x":"These work perfectly for my LipSense business as tester wands. They hold just enough product without using too much.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-19","r":2.0,"t":"Tops come off!","x":"A lot of the tops come off and I ended up wasting 1 of my products because 3 tops got stuck in the tube.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great for lipsense testers","x":"I use these for disposable wands for my lipsense testers. They work great. Highly recommend.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-21","r":5.0,"t":"Clients love these. I like to clean clients lashes with ...","x":"Clients love these. I like to clean clients lashes with these prior to service.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-22","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"I use these for my clients that want to try LipSense.  They work perfectly.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-23","r":5.0,"t":"Just what i needed.","x":"Perfect for my Lipsense testers. I will be ordering them again for sure.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B06XGGHYTZ-24","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Items arrived on time and worked wonderfully for Easter face painting.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise these applicators as great value, noting the large 300-pack quantity for a good price.","cites":[1,2,3,13,14,15]},{"text":"Many customers use them as disposable testers for their LipSense/lipstick business and say they work well for that purpose.","cites":[1,2,4,5,9,11]},{"text":"Users report the applicators apply lipstick smoothly and evenly, with several calling them sturdy and high quality.","cites":[1,4,9,14,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention quality inconsistencies, such as a tip breaking off or pink tops being less absorbent than black ones.","cites":[8,10]}]},"qa":[]}